Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: t736: reset the MDIO bus before PHY discovery

PH16 must be deasserted before the first PHY ID read. Child-level reset
acquisition happens after that read. Use the standard bus reset with the
board pulse and settling delays; keep PHY identification on the wire.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/t736-mainline-bringup.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/t736-mainline-bringup.dts
@@ -259,11 +259,14 @@
 			compatible = "snps,dwmac-mdio";
 			#address-cells = <1>;
 			#size-cells = <0>;
+			/* Release the sole PHY before reading its ID. A child reset
+			 * is only acquired after discovery and cannot bootstrap it.
+			 */
+			reset-gpios = <&pio 7 16 1>;
+			reset-delay-us = <10000>;
+			reset-post-delay-us = <150000>;
 			gmac0_phy: ethernet-phy@1 {
 				reg = <1>;
-				reset-gpios = <&pio 7 16 1>;
-				reset-assert-us = <10000>;
-				reset-deassert-us = <150000>;
 			};
 		};
 	};
